\ Template parsing tests

\ Basic template parsing - named placeholder
"Hello {name}!" template .

\ Direct display of template
"Hello {name}!" template .

\ Indexed placeholder
"{0} + {1}" template .

\ Identity placeholder
"value={}" template .

\ Literal only (no placeholders)
"hello world" template .

\ Escaped braces (double backslash to get literal backslash in the string)
"\\{literal\\}" template .

\ Format spec with width
"{name:width=2,fill=0}" template .

\ Type checking
"test {x}" template type-of .

\ Empty template
"" template .

\ Multiple named placeholders
"{city}, {state}" template .

\ Adjacent placeholders
"{first}{last}" template .

\ Error: unmatched open brace
[ "{oops" template ] [ . ] recover

\ Error: unmatched close brace
[ "oops}" template ] [ . ] recover
